<title>USA: MBIA qualifies eight muni issues for insurance.</title>
<headline>MBIA qualifies eight muni issues for insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>MBIA Insurance Corp. said Thursday it qualified for bond insurance the following eight municipal issues scheduled for competitive sale today:</p>
<p>--East Side Union High School, Calif., $11.5 million general obligation refunding bonds.</p>
<p>--East Side Union High School, Calif., $18.5 million GOs.</p>
<p>--Goleta Union School District, Calif., $3.8 million GOs.</p>
<p>--Urbandale Sanitary Sewers, Iowa, $2.635 million GOs.</p>
<p>--Dryden Central School District, N.Y., $12.025 million school district bonds.</p>
<p>--Oneida County, N.Y., $11.873 million public improvement bonds.</p>
<p>--Abilene, Texas, $2.4 million certificates of participation.</p>
<p>--Milwaukee County, Wis., $43.875 million GOs.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
